stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> RAISED: C1 a DET rule fires with no open candidate for the same rule and scope key
    RAISED --> RAISED: C2 the same rule fires again inside the dedupe window
    RAISED --> CONTAINED: C3 automatic containment taken, narrowing only
    RAISED --> HANDED_OFF: C4 hand-off record written, complete or with unknowns named
    CONTAINED --> HANDED_OFF: C4 hand-off record written, complete or with unknowns named
    HANDED_OFF --> HANDED_OFF: C5 further evidence appended
    HANDED_OFF --> ACKNOWLEDGED: C6 incident owner acknowledges
    ACKNOWLEDGED --> CLOSED: C7 owner records the outcome and decides each containment
    CLOSED --> [*]

    note right of HANDED_OFF
      The reportability decision and the
      six-hour CERT-In report belong to the
      incident owner under the section 17 runbook.
      The layer never holds a candidate back
      to complete its evidence.
    end note
